OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 4, dies after Range Rover
OL,4,Acrashes on country road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-year-old boy has died after a
OL,7,Fcar he was travelling in crashed on a
OL,8,Fcountry road in West Lothian.
OL,10,FThe crash involving a black Range Rover
OL,11,Fhappened on Drumcross Road near
OL,12,FBathgate at about 16:30 on Friday.
OL,14,FThe boy was taken to St John's Hospital
OL,15,Fin Livingston where he died a short
OL,16,Ftime later.
OL,18,FThe 28-year-old male driver of the
OL,19,FRange Rover was taken to Edinburgh
OL,20,FRoyal Infirmary for treatment.
